	(text_box "Differental amplifier with low pass filtered output. Design derived from EVLSPIN32G0A2 Evaluation Board.\nIntended for Field-Oriented Control of the Nanotec DF45 65W (10 A peak) or DF45 50W (7 A peak).\n\nAll Resistors except for R_{LP}: ±0.1% 25ppm/°C or better.\n\nIdeal Characteristics:\nVoltage Gain (G_{V/V}): 7.301 V/V\nCurrent Gain (G_{V/A}): 109.5 mV/A (15 mΩ shunt)\nCurrent Sense Range (I_{RANGE}): ±15.07 A\nOutput Offset (I_{SHUNT} = 0 A): 1.65 V\nLow Pass Filter Cutoff (-3 dB gain): 4.82 kHz"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 133.35 120.65 0)
		(size 133.35 25.4)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
